OL,3,GGrampian
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FA mostly
OL,6,Fcloudy in the evening and overnight
OL,7,Fwith showers feeding in from the
OL,8,Fnorth, perhaps heavier near northern
OL,9,Fcoasts but lighter with longer dry
OL,10,Fspells in the south. Hill snow.. A
OL,11,Ffrost inland with chance of some icy
OL,12,Fpatches.
OL,13,
OL,14,CFriday:FA mostly cloudy start with
OL,15,Fshowers, snow on hills. Showers will
OL,16,Fease through the morning becoming more
OL,17,Fconfined to northern coastal areas
OL,18,Fwith most having a dry sunny afternoon.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
